{
  "name": "hickory-dns",
  "description": "A modular and memory-safe DNS implementation written in Rust, featuring comprehensive support for client, server, resolver, and recursor roles. It integrates modern transport protocols including DNS-over-TLS, DNS-over-HTTPS, and DNS-over-QUIC alongside robust DNSSEC validation using NSEC3. The architecture prioritizes security and high-performance asynchronous I/O, providing a resilient alternative to legacy DNS infrastructure.",
